# Large binary outputs
# NOTE: These directories are excluded from git. To regenerate:
#   Phase 1-4 results:  Run notebooks 01-04 in order (see README.md).
#   Checkpoints:        Run notebooks/03_finetuning.ipynb (requires GPU, ~80 min/run).
#   Paper figures:      Run notebooks/05_figures.ipynb after 01-04 complete.
#   ONNX models:        Run src/viz/dashboard/onnx_export.py after checkpoints exist.
#   DVC (future):       `dvc pull` will fetch all outputs once DVC remote is configured.
